00:12:13,860 --> 00:12:14,500
天啊
Oh, my God.

326
00:12:15,513 --> 00:12:18,813
迪蘭的媽媽是不是很眼熟
Is, uh -- Is Dylan's mom at all familiar to you?

327
00:12:18,860 --> 00:12:21,120
是的 謝天謝地你也注意到了
Yes! Thank God you noticed it, too.

328
00:12:21,443 --> 00:12:23,953
我不敢相信這將會成為我們生活的常態
I can't believe that is gonna be in our life on a regular basis.

329
00:12:23,953 --> 00:12:26,103
我知道 她快要把我弄瘋了
I know. She's been driving me kind of crazy

330
00:12:26,160 --> 00:12:27,200
自我小時候開始
since I was a kid.

331
00:12:27,380 --> 00:12:29,080
你知道有多少個夜晚我在床上
Do you know how many nights I went to bed

332
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:30,700
用枕頭捂著嘴大叫她的名字嗎
screaming her name into a pillow?

333
00:12:31,220 --> 00:12:32,020
繼續說
Go on.

334
00:12:33,520 --> 00:12:36,100
-她弄壞了 -不 是你弄壞了
- She broke it! - No, you broke it!

335
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:38,540
姑娘們 沒關系 另外 你們是誰
Girls, it's fine! Also, who are you?

336
00:12:38,540 --> 00:12:40,500
我每月得帶一次我的繼女
Oh, I get my stepdaughters once a month

337
00:12:40,500 --> 00:12:42,920
我前妻要在國民警衛隊輪班
when my ex-wife's on rotation with the National Guard.

338
00:12:43,433 --> 00:12:45,323
孩子們 小心南美栗鼠 好嗎
Mm. Girls, be careful with the chinchilla, okay?

339
00:12:45,323 --> 00:12:47,003
你們知道他很容易被嚇得屁滾尿流
You know he has a nervous bowel.

340
00:12:47,003 --> 00:12:49,453
-姑娘們 -阿嬤
- Hi, girls! - Gammy!

341
00:12:49,453 --> 00:12:50,464
阿嬤
Gammy?

342
00:12:50,733 --> 00:12:51,923
姑娘們叫你阿嬤嗎
The girls call you Gammy?

343
00:12:51,980 --> 00:12:53,160
有意思了 因為我也希望
That's funny, because I was hoping

344
00:12:53,160 --> 00:12:54,560
海莉的雙胞胎將來
when Haley's twins came along,

345
00:12:54,980 --> 00:12:56,200
這么叫我
they might call me that.

346
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:58,180
那恐怕會容易弄混
Oh, well, that might be confusing.

347
00:12:58,240 --> 00:12:59,860
但你可以被叫做其他啊
But maybe you could be something else.

348
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:02,300
-嬤嬤怎么樣 -或許我們現在
- How about "Gaga"? - Maybe we don't have to lock

349
00:13:02,300 --> 00:13:03,460
還不用確定任何叫法下來
anything down right now.

350
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:05,800
天啊 我喜歡
Oh, my God. I love it!

351
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:06,900
你好啊 嬤嬤
Hey, Gaga!

352
00:13:07,242 --> 00:13:09,742
小鼠跑了 抓住他
Squeaker's loose! Get him!

353
00:13:12,122 --> 00:13:13,213
我來
I'll get him!

354
00:13:16,860 --> 00:13:19,060
-你看到了嗎 菲爾 -什么
- Do you see it, Phil? - What?!

355
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,540
沒 我什么也沒看到
No, I didn't see anything, so...

356
00:13:22,422 --> 00:13:24,262
對不起 小迪
I'm so sorry, D!

357
00:13:24,262 --> 00:13:25,342
如果你不是我的偶像
If you weren't my hero,

358
00:13:25,342 --> 00:13:27,182
我要懷疑你是故意的了
I'd wonder if you're doing this on purpose!

359
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:28,540
天啊 爸爸
Oh, my God, Dad!

360
00:13:28,580 --> 00:13:30,020
他怎么回事啊 媽
What's wrong with him, Mom?

361
00:13:30,540 --> 00:13:31,960
-媽 -克萊爾
- Mom? - Claire?

362
00:13:32,740 --> 00:13:33,020
嬤嬤
Gaga?

363
00:13:38,522 --> 00:13:40,582
帥哥 這個座位有人嗎
Hey, handsome, this seat taken?

364
00:13:40,700 --> 00:13:41,500
你來這干嘛
Hey, what are you doing here?

365
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:43,020
我給你帶了奶昔 但...
Well, I brought you a smoothie, although,

366
00:13:43,020 --> 00:13:44,720
你不需要 因為你已經是
you don't need it because you're already

367
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:47,660
百分百的美味果繽紛了
100% fruity deliciousness.

368
00:13:47,761 --> 00:13:48,851
或許我該直奔主題
Maybe I just get right to it.

369
00:13:48,851 --> 00:13:50,911
米奇爾 我很感激你的心意...
Look, Mitchell, I appreciate what you're doing --

370
00:13:50,911 --> 00:13:52,062
不 聽我說
No, no, listen.

371
00:13:52,081 --> 00:13:53,491
莉莉今晚去朋友家過夜
Lily's at a sleepover tonight,

372
00:13:53,491 --> 00:13:57,171
所以我在耳語度假水療中心定了套房
so I got us a suite at Whispers Resort and Spa.

373
00:13:57,621 --> 00:13:59,381
就是珍妮弗·安妮斯頓離婚后
Isn't that the place, uh, Jen Aniston goes to

374
00:13:59,381 --> 00:14:00,831
-去的那家嗎 -是的
- after her divorces? - Yes.

375
00:14:00,831 --> 00:14:03,151
《花花女郎》的事我很抱歉
And I'm sorry about the silly Playgirl thing.

376
00:14:03,151 --> 00:14:05,551
我想讓你體驗我每天所體驗的感覺
I-I want you to feel what I feel every day.

377
00:14:05,551 --> 00:14:07,931
就是你眼里除了我沒有別人
That you only have eyes for me.

378
00:14:09,580 --> 00:14:12,160
你可以說我傳統 我就是心里容不下別的男人
Call me old-fashioned. I just don't see other men.

379
00:14:13,581 --> 00:14:15,491
親愛的 你的心率高到警報響了
Sweetie, your-your heart rate's setting off an alarm.

380
00:14:15,491 --> 00:14:16,611
你還是先別騎車了
Why-why don't you get off that bike?

381
00:14:16,611 --> 00:14:18,031
是啊 好主意 不如這樣
Yeah, that's a good idea. You know what?

382
00:14:18,031 --> 00:14:19,741
我們先去水療 看能不能提前開始項目
Why don't we go to the spa, see if we can get an early treatment?

383
00:14:19,741 --> 00:14:20,812
我喜歡
I love that.

384
00:14:21,401 --> 00:14:22,322
奶昔
Oh, smoothie.

385
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:23,680
好的
Okay.

386
00:14:24,741 --> 00:14:26,661
你真的出了好多汗
Hey, you're-you're really sweating.

387
00:14:26,771 --> 00:14:28,121
你該拿條毛巾擦擦了
You should get a towel.

388
00:14:30,900 --> 00:14:32,120
你表現得好奇怪
Okay, you're acting weird.

389
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:34,260
-到底怎么回事 -好吧 我只是
- What's going on? - Okay, look, I just --

390
00:14:35,160 --> 00:14:37,420
因為酒店很興奮
Um, I'm excited about that hotel.

391
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:39,280
那里發生過好多好萊塢名人名事
I mean, there's a lot of Hollywood history there.

392
00:14:39,500 --> 00:14:40,740
傳聞
You know, they say

393
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:43,280
《小淘氣》那幫演員常在那搞群交
the Little Rascals used to have orgies there.

394
00:14:44,300 --> 00:14:45,080
小卡
Hey, Cam!

395
00:14:45,780 --> 00:14:48,520
我差點忘了你給我們做的自制蛋白棒
I almost forgot the homemade protein bars you brought for us!

396
00:14:48,860 --> 00:14:49,800
下次見
Well, I'll see you next time!

397
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:51,220
好 這人誰啊
Yeah! Who is that?

398
00:14:51,560 --> 00:14:53,600
這片風光可真有意思
Wow, that's an interesting view.

399
00:14:54,730 --> 00:14:55,730
哪有意思了 停車場而已
What? It's a parking lot.

400
00:14:55,730 --> 00:14:57,120
-那有個垃圾桶 -拜托 少來了
- There's a Dumpster. - Oh, please. Come on.

401
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,940
你選這輛單車是為了能在前排
You picked this bike so you could have a front-row seat

402
00:14:58,940 --> 00:15:00,450
觀摩這場猛男...
to this little peep sho-

403
00:15:00,780 --> 00:15:01,940
我的天
Oh! Oh, my God.

404
00:15:01,940 --> 00:15:04,140
我們那晚"超乎尋常的體驗"
That night of our "Spectacular session,"

405
00:15:04,300 --> 00:15:05,720
正好是你從健身房回家后
you had just come from the gym.

406
00:15:05,750 --> 00:15:08,560
真好奇你那天勁頭為什么那么足
Well, I-I wonder what got your engine so revved up, huh?

407
00:15:08,700 --> 00:15:10,380
真相就在外面
The truth is out there!

408
00:15:10,760 --> 00:15:11,620
你知道嗎
Okay, you know what?

409
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:12,620
我很容易動搖 行了吧
I'm weak, okay?

410
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:15,739
真不敢相信你因為我看雜志而羞辱我
I can't believe you shamed me for looking at a magazine

411
00:15:15,739 --> 00:15:17,569
而你一直在給這群猛男
when you've been baking protein bars

412
00:15:17,569 --> 00:15:19,789
-做蛋白棒 -或許就是這個原因
- for Thunder from Down Under! - Maybe that's why.

413
00:15:19,789 --> 00:15:21,979
這讓我很內疚
It's because I-I felt guilty about this.

414
00:15:22,020 --> 00:15:23,280
不必內疚 明白嗎
Well, don't, okay?

415
00:15:23,340 --> 00:15:25,640
我們可以去看其他男人
We are allowed to look at other men

416
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:27,720
不必覺得內疚
without feeling guilty about it.

417
00:15:30,399 --> 00:15:33,139
要是這樣能激發你 大可去看
And-and if it inspires you, then go for it,

418
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:34,220
因為歸根結底
because at the end of the day,

419
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:36,620
好處都是我享用了
I'm the one who gets to reap the rewards.

420
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:40,060
這話沒錯 好吧 我很抱歉
That's true. Okay. Look, I'm sorry.

421
00:15:40,100 --> 00:15:41,140
我們快離開這吧
Let's just get out of here.

422
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:42,540
這就走 好吧
Oh, now? Okay.

423
00:15:44,640 --> 00:15:45,780
或許我該加入這間健身房
Maybe I should join this gym.

424
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:47,100
不行 繼續看你的懷舊裸男雜志去
No, stick to your vintage nudie mags.

425
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:47,740
這里是我的
This is mine.

426
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:50,040
-他叫什么 -查克
- What's his name? - Chuck.

427
00:15:50,260 --> 00:15:50,960
查克
Oh, Chuck.

428
00:15:52,479 --> 00:15:54,019
喬 太可愛了
Oh, Joe, so adorable,

429
00:15:54,100 --> 00:15:56,300
你看起來像幼年版阿爾瓦羅先祖
you look like a little Uncle Alvaro!

430
00:15:56,469 --> 00:15:58,509
最后的點睛之筆 懷表
One last touch -- the pocket watch,

431
00:15:58,509 --> 00:16:00,049
永遠停在3點30分
permanently broken at 3:30

432
00:16:00,049 --> 00:16:02,268
因為它擋住了善妒的弗洛倫斯·南丁格爾
after it stopped a bullet shot by a very drunk

433
00:16:02,340 --> 00:16:03,760
酒醉后射出的子彈
and jealous Florence Nightingale.

434
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:05,700
或許我是酸葡萄心理
Maybe it was sour grapes,

435
00:16:05,700 --> 00:16:08,240
但我開始覺得這家伙是個騙子
but this guy was starting to sound like baloney.

436
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:11,780
我很確定假如我用盡一切手段
I was sure that if I left no stone unturned,

437
00:16:11,860 --> 00:16:13,560
最終 某天
eventually, one day,

438
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:16,440
我會找到先祖阿爾瓦羅的丑聞
I'd find some dirt on Great Uncle Alvaro.

439
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:17,980
我就知道
I knew it!

440
00:16:18,278 --> 00:16:20,888
西蒙·弗朗西斯科·阿爾瓦羅
Simón Francisco Alvaro

441
00:16:20,888 --> 00:16:24,378
輾轉于不同小鎮 勾引有錢寡婦
would go from town to town, seducing wealthy widows

442
00:16:24,378 --> 00:16:27,728
編造自己在戰爭中的勇敢故事騙她們
with made-up stories of his bravery in battle.

443
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:31,140
把她們的所有錢財都浪費在喝酒賭博上
After frittering away their fortunes on drink and dice,

444
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:34,420
然后換下一目標 只給他的受害人
he would move on, leaving his victims with nothing

445
00:16:34,420 --> 00:16:36,740
留下一枝紅玫瑰
but a single red rose

446
00:16:36,740 --> 00:16:37,980
和梅毒
and syphilis.

447
00:16:38,280 --> 00:16:40,240
有人想聽歷史小課堂嗎
Who's up for a little history lesson?

448
00:16:40,648 --> 00:16:42,518
-看起來 -等一下
- It seems -- - Wait, wait, wait, wait.

449
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:43,460
再演一次
Do it again.

450
00:16:44,260 --> 00:16:46,520
哥倫比亞的肩頭
The yoke of Spanish oppression

451
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:50,240
將不會再套上西班牙壓迫的韁繩
will chafe Colombian shoulders no longer!

452
00:16:50,377 --> 00:16:53,367
我的佩劍在渴求歐洲人的鮮血
My saber thirsts for European blood!

453
00:16:53,367 --> 00:16:55,437
-太可愛了 -好極了
- So cute! - Bravo!

454
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:58,700
他自己查到背下來的
He looked it up and memorized it himself.

455
00:16:58,987 --> 00:17:00,827
爸 你知道那些孩子
Hey, Dad. You know how kids tease me

456
00:17:00,827 --> 00:17:02,887
總笑我是班上最矮的嗎
'cause I'm the shortest kid in the class?

457
00:17:02,887 --> 00:17:04,297
可別聽他們說的那些鬼話
Oh, don't listen to what they say!

458
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:07,900
沒錯 先祖阿爾瓦羅只有一米五
Right! Uncle Alvaro was only five feet tall

459
00:17:07,900 --> 00:17:09,640
可是他領導了一整支軍隊
and he led a whole army!

460
00:17:09,860 --> 00:17:11,820
我要像他一樣勇敢
I'm gonna be brave like him.

461
00:17:14,520 --> 00:17:16,400
先祖阿爾瓦羅萬歲
Viva Uncle Alvaro.

462
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:19,660
我享受了很多年以我先祖為榮的日子
I enjoyed a lot of years taking pride in my great uncle.

463
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:21,460
我不想奪走喬在這方面的機會
I didn't want to rob Joe of that.

464
00:17:21,460 --> 00:17:23,800
忍著不說真的很不容易
It wasn't easy biting my tongue,

465
00:17:23,800 --> 00:17:26,960
但我向家族里另一個偉大的先人學習
but I took a page from another heroic relative --

466
00:17:27,207 --> 00:17:28,967
他就是魯拉赫·麥普里契特
Lulach McPritchett --

467
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:32,060
勇敢驕傲的蘇格蘭勇士 被英國佬所捕獲
proud Scottish warrior, captured by the English,

468
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:35,720
用盡世上各種手段刑求逼供
tortured for months using every method imaginable,

469
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:38,340
但他還是沒有透漏任何一點秘密
and never once giving up a single secret.

470
00:17:39,300 --> 00:17:40,320
別去查他
Don't look him up.

471
00:17:47,636 --> 00:17:51,056
夫人[意語] 為何如此難過
Signora, why so sad?

472
00:17:51,056 --> 00:17:54,116
讓我看看你如通心粉般的大微笑好嗎
Let me see that big macaroni smile, ah?

473
00:17:54,180 --> 00:17:55,440
你怎么找到我在這
How did you find me?

474
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:57,480
安東尼奧打電話來說
Antonio called and said

475
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:59,160
你點了一杯燃燒森布卡茴香酒...
you'd ordered a flaming Sambuca...

476
00:17:59,160 --> 00:18:00,920
但一口沒喝 只靜靜看它燃燒
...and just watched it burn.

477
00:18:02,780 --> 00:18:04,860
一切都發展得太快了
It's all just going too fast.

478
00:18:05,526 --> 00:18:06,616
五個月前
Five months ago,

479
00:18:06,616 --> 00:18:08,046
海莉剛跟迪蘭復合
Haley got back together with Dylan.

480
00:18:08,046 --> 00:18:10,596
然后我媽媽去世 再接著海莉就懷孕了
Then my mom dies. Then Haley's pregnant.

481
00:18:10,660 --> 00:18:11,700
后來還發現是雙胞胎
Then it's twins.

482
00:18:11,956 --> 00:18:14,686
接下來"搬過來暫住一個夏天"變成了
Then, "Come move in with us this summer" turns into

483
00:18:14,686 --> 00:18:17,335
"叮咚 為您帶來雙胞胎提前體驗包
"Ding-dong, we're here with an early preview of twins

484
00:18:17,335 --> 00:18:18,925
與一只大小便失控的南美栗鼠
and an incontinent chinchilla,

485
00:18:18,925 --> 00:18:21,485
而且呢 比《猛鬼街》殺人魔佛萊迪
and, in the most terrifying return since Freddy Krueger

486
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:23,460
重返榆樹街大開殺戒還可怕的是
sashayed his way back onto Elm Street,

487
00:18:24,020 --> 00:18:27,600
我媽媽轉世附身在了法拉的身體上"
my mother reincarnated into the body of Farrah."

488
00:18:30,275 --> 00:18:32,415
你... 你怎么能對這一切都如此淡定
How -- How are you handling this all so well?

489
00:18:32,460 --> 00:18:33,500
誰說我淡定了
Who says I am?

490
00:18:34,185 --> 00:18:35,085
我不得不離開家里
I had to get out of there,

491
00:18:35,085 --> 00:18:37,305
不然我要害海莉成為單親媽媽了
or I was gonna make Haley a single mom.

492
00:18:37,700 --> 00:18:39,260
我連傷了迪蘭兩次
I hit Dylan again, Claire.

493
00:18:39,540 --> 00:18:41,560
-但你不是有意的啊 -能確定嗎
- But not on purpose. - Are we sure?

494
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:44,700
你是說你心里可能暗藏怨念
You mean, like, you might have some buried anger

495
00:18:44,700 --> 00:18:46,800
記恨他偷走了你的寶貝閨女嗎
towards him stealing away your baby girl?

496
00:18:46,800 --> 00:18:49,480
我真希望你是故意的
Oh, I so want it to be on purpose.

497
00:18:49,785 --> 00:18:51,995
我自己一個人在瘋人島上好孤獨啊
Gets lonely out here on crazy island.

498
00:18:53,495 --> 00:18:55,045
沒事啦
Oh, well,

499
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:56,880
我們好歹還有意大利嘛
we still have Italy.

500
00:18:58,380 --> 00:18:59,120
真的有嗎
Do we?

501
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:01,960
聽我說 我上網查過了雙胞胎
Listen, I've been doing some research on twins,

502
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:04,380
它們容易像我們的女兒當年那樣
and it seems that, like our daughter, they --

503
00:19:04,624 --> 00:19:06,014
提早出生
they tend to come early.

504
00:19:06,014 --> 00:19:08,094
但哪怕只有10%的幾率
Even if it's a 1-in-10 chance,

505
00:19:08,094 --> 00:19:11,984
我也不想到時候海莉身邊唯一的母性角色
I can't risk having the only maternal figure present

506
00:19:11,984 --> 00:19:14,284
是那個浴缸生產的妖女
be that tub-birthing Wiccan.

507
00:19:14,614 --> 00:19:16,175
我得在她身邊陪她
I got to be there for Haley.

508
00:19:16,814 --> 00:19:18,194
的確是很壓力山大
It's overwhelming for sure,

509
00:19:18,194 --> 00:19:21,834
但我們許許多多的美好回憶
but haven't a ton of our best memories

510
00:19:21,840 --> 00:19:24,000
不都是從一家人的各種混亂中產生的嗎
come from the anarchy of our house?

511
00:19:24,840 --> 00:19:27,520
比如盧克把腦袋卡在欄桿中
Like when Luke got his head stuck in the banister?

512
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:28,660
哪一次被卡住
Which time?

513
00:19:29,294 --> 00:19:31,954
或是艾麗克斯的科學展覽設計
Or when -- when Alex's science fair project

514
00:19:32,120 --> 00:19:33,400
害整個鄰里各家各戶都停電了
blacked out the whole neighborhood

515
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:34,900
而且還是在超級碗期間
during the Super Bowl?

516
00:19:35,404 --> 00:19:36,795
還有
Or when, uh,

517
00:19:36,934 --> 00:19:38,224
海莉想從盧克的窗戶溜進家
Haley snuck in Luke's window

518
00:19:38,260 --> 00:19:40,680
-結果那周我們才剛給盧克買了彈弓 -天啊
- the same week we bought him a slingshot? - Oh, God.

519
00:19:40,704 --> 00:19:42,045
真的是...
That was... Mm.

520
00:19:42,114 --> 00:19:44,254
我們家是有點像瘋人之家
So, it's a-a madhouse,

521
00:19:44,254 --> 00:19:46,674
但換另一個角度想
but on the other hand,

522
00:19:46,674 --> 00:19:48,293
這個家馬上就要迎接幾個新的寶寶了
we're gonna have a couple babies in the house,

523
00:19:48,293 --> 00:19:50,503
他們會是海莉與迪蘭的寶寶
and they'll be Haley and Dylan's.

524
00:19:51,600 --> 00:19:53,320
他們一定會鬧出很多笑料
So they'll be doing funny stuff.

525
00:19:57,820 --> 00:19:58,380
所以...
So...

526
00:19:58,380 --> 00:20:00,480
感覺我們還是會去旅行啦
looks like we are going on a trip?

527
00:20:19,360 --> 00:20:20,760
-格雷琴 -曼尼爾
- Gretchen. - Manuel.

528
00:20:21,380 --> 00:20:23,840
我對我們不歡而散感到抱歉
Look, I really am sorry about the way things ended --

529
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:24,840
為時已晚
That chapter is closed.

530
00:20:24,940 --> 00:20:26,860
我們現在是單純的工作關系
We have a strictly business relationship now.

531
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:30,700
還喜歡這本書嗎 還是你的眼睛
Did you enjoy this book, or did you find your eyes

532
00:20:30,700 --> 00:20:33,020
瞟向了更短小的猶太書籍[人]
drifting toward a shorter Jewish one?

533
00:20:33,292 --> 00:20:35,212
聽我說 我跟肖莎娜已經結束了
Okay, Shoshana and I are over.

534
00:20:35,212 --> 00:20:36,902
最傷心的就是當我發現
It was beyond hurtful that you found a woman

535
00:20:36,902 --> 00:20:39,692
你另找的姑娘名字里還帶有兩個"噓"的音
whose name has two "shhh" sounds in it.

536
00:20:39,752 --> 00:20:40,832
顯然你還在傷心
Clearly, you're still upset

537
00:20:40,832 --> 00:20:42,532
而且看來也沒機會握手言和了
and there is no hope for reconciliation.

538
00:20:42,560 --> 00:20:43,020
既然如此
So...

539
00:20:43,882 --> 00:20:44,682
我想向你道別
I'll just say good-bye

540
00:20:44,740 --> 00:20:47,440
并希望你會允許我在我們的愛歌中退場
and hope you'll allow me to play myself off with our song.
